OL,3,GNEWSACouncil wants new team to tackle
OL,4,Atown nuisances
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a team of new public space
OL,7,Fofficers to patrol Loughborough to
OL,8,Ftackle anti-social behaviour are set to
OL,9,Fgiven the go-ahead.
OL,11,FCharnwood Borough Council's cabinet has
OL,12,Fbeen advised by the authority's
OL,13,Fcommunity safety team to approve
OL,14,Fproposals on 12 November to create a
OL,15,Fnew public spaces officer patrol in the
OL,16,Ftown.
OL,18,FAccording to the Labour-run council the
OL,19,Fservice would cost about #250,000 a
OL,20,Fyear, and would comprise of four
OL,21,Ffull-time public space officers plus a
OL,22,Fpart-time business support role.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
