OL,3,GNEWSACouncil wants new team to tackle
OL,4,Atown nuisances
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as the council carries out a
OL,7,Ffinal consultation on proposals to
OL,8,Fintroduce a new public spaces
OL,9,Fprotection order (PSPO), which includes
OL,10,Fa ban on wearing face coverings.
